{"id":"violencia","lemma":"violencia","pos":"noun","rank":1412,"glosses":["violence","act of violence"],"ipa":"/bjoˈlenθja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"violencias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/32/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-violencia.wav","examples":[{"text":"No nos gusta la violencia.","en":"We don't like violence.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460099","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"us"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"La violencia es el cáncer de nuestra sociedad.","en":"Violence is the cancer of our society.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/706080","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"cancer"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"our, ours, to us","l":"nuestro"},{"g":"society, social order"}]},{"text":"No puedo soportar más su violencia.","en":"I can't put up with his violence any longer.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/527157","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to bear"},{"g":"more"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"¿Qué ha llegado a lograr la violencia?","en":"What has violence ever accomplished?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"arrived"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to get, to obtain"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Debemos acabar con la violencia.","en":"We must do away with violence.","words":[{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"to finish"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}